not-this: "Not an RPC surface. The reconciliation operations the original exposed as bus messages — occupancy, roster stamp, template audit, delete-slot, empty, write-template as a wire verb — do not exist here; the push owns all of them inside the device. The bus carries semantics, not mechanism."
